From d1f98a9e72ceab726ada12d8fceeb1d691946cfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev Contributor <dev@example.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 10:12:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] covariance: reject constant columns when computing
 correlation

Correlation is undefined for a column with zero variance. Add a DAAL
ConstantColumnsKernel that finds such columns with a single parallel pass
over the data, and call it from the oneAPI CPU covariance kernel so that a
clear invalid_argument is raised instead of NaNs in the output.
